      "description": { "ms": "Nama rangkaian dan kata laluan Wi-Fi; jurulatih mengisinya pada halaman kohort.", "en": "Wi-Fi network name and password; the trainer fills it in on the cohort page." },
      "scope": "cohort"
    },
    {
